    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄᾱς</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to-morrow</i> or <i>the day after to-morrow,</i> gen. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠώς</span>
			, read by <i><span class="en">
				Zenod.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠοῦς</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.470
			</span></i> (cf. Sch.Ven.); as Adv. in 
				Boeot.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀές.</span></div>
